<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!--
  phase-05/plists/com.ohama.kanban.plist — versioned staging source for
  ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.ohama.kanban.plist (installed by
  phase-05/services/install_services.sh, brought up only by
  phase-02/infra/restart_service.sh — never hand-loaded).

  Non-obvious choices, recorded here because the dict below must stay
  plutil-clean and cannot itself carry prose:

  - EnvironmentVariables.PATH includes /opt/homebrew/bin because
    /opt/homebrew/bin/kanban is a `#!/usr/bin/env node` shebang script —
    without node reachable on PATH the service dies at exec, before any
    application code runs.
  - WorkingDirectory is the sandboxed workdir (workspace/scratch-repo), not
    the repo root: THE CWD RULE (docs/headless-wrapper.md sec 6) — a
    launchd-supervised process whose OS-level cwd is not already inside
    workspace/ALLOWED_REPOS.json dies at Bun/Node startup with a generic,
    path-less error that looks exactly like a sandbox tightening, not a cwd
    bug. The wrapper script also `cd`s and asserts this — belt and braces.
  - StandardOutPath/StandardErrorPath live under ~/.cline/logs/ (NOT the
    other three house services' ~/llm-system/services/logs/) because
    launchd opens these fds itself and the sandboxed child inherits them
    across exec; only ~/.cline is punched read+write through the sandbox
    profile. Redirecting sandboxed stdio at an unpunched path has produced
    a bare SIGABRT five separate times in this project — this is the fix,
    not a style choice.
  - ThrottleInterval 30 matches THROTTLE_INTERVAL in
    phase-05/services/config.env, inside the house range (10-60s).
  - RunAtLoad true is the reboot-persistence mechanism.
  - Both CLINE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE and KANBAN_NO_AUTO_UPDATE are set —
    kanban has its own, separate auto-update gate (confirmed via `strings`
    on the installed binary) that CLINE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE does not cover.
  - --port 3484 is pinned in ProgramArguments (via the wrapper); kanban's
    other well-known default port never appears anywhere in this file
    (ROADMAP Phase 6 criterion 3).
-->
<dict>
	<key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
	<dict>
		<key>CLINE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE</key>
		<string>1</string>
		<key>KANBAN_NO_AUTO_UPDATE</key>
		<string>1</string>
		<key>PATH</key>
		<string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
	</dict>
	<key>KeepAlive</key>
	<true/>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.ohama.kanban</string>
	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/bin/bash</string>
		<string>/Users/ohama/projs/cline-tests/phase-05/services/run_kanban_service.sh</string>
	</array>
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>/Users/ohama/.cline/logs/kanban.err</string>
	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>/Users/ohama/.cline/logs/kanban.log</string>
	<key>ThrottleInterval</key>
	<integer>30</integer>
	<key>WorkingDirectory</key>
	<string>/Users/ohama/projs/cline-tests/workspace/scratch-repo</string>
</dict>
</plist>
